{
  "key": "letter-245-part-01",
  "number": 245,
  "generationId": "01a1e8f9-9aa4-7791-9270-e7b8c137b63f",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-245/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.674739
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Why does man suffer?",
      "path": "audio/1971-245/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.032404,
      "end": 3.6119950000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Man suffers because of his craving, craving to possess that which cannot be possessed, and craving to keep things forever with himself which are essentially impermanent.",
      "path": "audio/1971-245/03.mp3",
      "start": 4.976531,
      "end": 14.807846
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "And chief among these things is his own ego, his own persona.",
      "path": "audio/1971-245/04.mp3",
      "start": 16.228685,
      "end": 20.751179
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "But all things are impermanent.",
      "path": "audio/1971-245/05.mp3",
      "start": 22.045782,
      "end": 24.180476000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Except for change itself everything changes.",
      "path": "audio/1971-245/06.mp3",
      "start": 25.415056999999997,
      "end": 28.279683000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Really nothing is because everything is only a process, so as soon as one tries to possess anything it slips away.",
      "path": "audio/1971-245/07.mp3",
      "start": 29.458209,
      "end": 35.769909
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "The possessor himself is slipping away constantly!",
      "path": "audio/1971-245/08.mp3",
      "start": 37.051769,
      "end": 39.871542
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Then there is frustration and then there is suffering.",
      "path": "audio/1971-245/09.mp3",
      "start": 41.444921,
      "end": 44.953559999999996
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Know this well, realize this well and there will be no suffering because then you have unearthed the root.",
      "path": "audio/1971-245/10.mp3",
      "start": 46.490272000000004,
      "end": 54.65
    }
  ]
}
